      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "Pero hay un dios que lo ve todo: Helios, el Sol. Cada día cruza el cielo en su carro brillante.",
          "en": "But one god sees everything: Helios, the Sun. Every day, he drives his bright chariot across the sky."
        },
        {
          "es": "Desde allá arriba, nada en la tierra puede esconderse de su luz.",
          "en": "From up there, nothing on earth can hide from his light."
        },
        {
          "es": "Helios miró hacia abajo y vio a Ares y a Afrodita juntos.",
          "en": "Helios looked down and saw Ares and Aphrodite together."
        },
        {
          "es": "No guardó el secreto. Fue directo a ver a Hefesto y le contó todo.",
          "en": "He did not keep the secret. He went straight to Hephaestus and told him everything."
        }
      ],
