      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "Entonces Hefesto hizo una trampa. Dijo que se iba a Lemnos, su isla favorita.",
          "en": "Then Hephaestus played a trick. He said he was going away to Lemnos, his favorite island."
        },
        {
          "es": "Era la tierra que más quería en todo el mundo.",
          "en": "It was the land he loved most in all the world."
        },
        {
          "es": "Se fue cojeando por el camino, despacio, para que todos lo vieran partir.",
          "en": "He limped away down the road, slowly, so that everyone could see him leave."
        },
        {
          "es": "Ares lo miraba desde lejos. En cuanto Hefesto se fue, sonrió.",
          "en": "Ares was watching from far away. As soon as Hephaestus was gone, he smiled."
        },
        {
          "es": "Corrió a la casa de Hefesto, donde Afrodita lo esperaba.",
          "en": "He ran to the house of Hephaestus, where Aphrodite was waiting."
        }
      ],
