      "camara": {
        "de": 0,
        "a": 250
      },
      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "Hefesto volvió enseguida. Se paró en la puerta, ardiendo de rabia.",
          "en": "Hephaestus came back at once. He stood at the door, burning with anger."
        },
        {
          "es": "Entonces hizo algo que nadie esperaba. Llamó a todos los dioses para que vinieran a mirar.",
          "en": "Then he did something no one expected. He called all the gods to come and look."
        },
        {
          "es": "«¡Padre Zeus, ven a ver!», gritó. «Mi esposa ama a Ares porque es hermoso y veloz, y yo soy cojo».",
          "en": "\"Father Zeus, come and see!\" he shouted. \"My wife loves Ares because he is handsome and fast, and I am lame.\""
        },
        {
          "es": "Dijo que no abriría la red hasta que Zeus le devolviera todos los regalos de boda.",
          "en": "He said he would not open the net until Zeus gave back all his wedding gifts."
        },
        {
          "es": "¿Tú habrías llamado a todos para que vieran, o habrías guardado tu dolor en secreto?",
          "en": "Would you have called everyone to see, or kept your pain a secret?"
        }
      ],
