      },
      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "Los dioses llegaron corriendo a la casa. Entre ellos estaba Poseidón, el dios del mar.",
          "en": "The gods came running to the house. Among them was Poseidon, the god of the sea."
        },
        {
          "es": "Pero las diosas se quedaron en casa. Sentían que no estaba bien mirar.",
          "en": "But the goddesses stayed at home. They felt it was not right to look."
        },
        {
          "es": "Los dioses se pararon en la puerta y vieron a los dos amantes en la red. Y se echaron a reír.",
          "en": "The gods stood at the door and saw the two lovers in the net. And they began to laugh."
        },
        {
          "es": "Homero dice que su risa no paraba. Resonaba en todo el Olimpo.",
          "en": "Homer says their laughter would not stop. It rang through all of Olympus."
        },
        {
          "es": "«Miren», decían. «El lento atrapó al rápido. Hefesto, el cojo, atrapó a Ares, el más veloz».",
          "en": "\"Look,\" they said. \"The slow one has caught the fast one. Lame Hephaestus caught Ares, the fastest.\""
        }
      ],
